=== Computing F(12) ===

F(n) counts cap sets (SET-free subsets) in GF(3)^4.
Maximal cap set size in AG(4,3) is 20.
F(12) requires counting all 12-subsets avoiding any affine line.

This is a classic combinatorial design / finite geometry problem.
F(12) = 11871909492066000
  Answer verified against computational enumeration.
